{[#]} 1. Rb8# {The Lawnmower Mate is an easy checkmate typically performed by
a queen and rook (or just two rooks). The two pieces work together to push the
enemy king to the side of the board. Since it is a very commoncheckmate
pattern, it is one of the first checkmate methods that a beginner should learn.
} *

